;; --- THE FUELED COMPOSITIONS: the walks, quantified over raw draws ---------------
;;
;; M0's induction shape verbatim: the world spelled as ssm_ws with a
;; terminator tail, fuel = the ground head over the one-S-per-iteration
;; ladder, f universally quantified (the monotone-threshold form), the
;; head registers quantified and never in the conclusion. The EOF
;; terminator's memory is the ssm_mem fold with the finalizer transform
;; on top, kf exhibited by wnat.

(claim ssm_walk_eof
  (goal
    ((its (List SsmIt))
     (m0 Mem)
